    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 練習二：匯率警報看板（標準答案）\n\n**流程：**\n1. Manual Trigger 啟動\n2. HTTP GET 抓即時匯率 JSON\n3. Code 從 200+ 幣別篩出 JPY/TWD/KRW\n4. IF 判斷日圓是否超過 155\n5. Set 格式化人類可讀的提醒訊息\n\n**驗收：**\n✅ Code 輸出含 jpy/twd/krw 匯率\n✅ IF 根據當前匯率走正確分支\n✅ Set 輸出完整提醒訊息",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "p2-sticky-main",
      "name": "Sticky Note — 說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -976,
        192
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 2: HTTP GET\n\nURL: `https://tw.rter.info/capi.php`\n免認證 JSON API\n\n回傳 200+ 種幣別匯率\n→ 點 Output 找 USDJPY",
        "height": 288,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "p2-sticky-http",
      "name": "Sticky Note — HTTP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -368,
        592
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 3: Code 篩選\n\n從大物件中取值：\n`raw.USDJPY.Exrate`\n`raw.USDTWD.Exrate`\n`raw.USDKRW.Exrate`\n\nJSON 取值 = L02 Expression",
        "height": 276,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "p2-sticky-code",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Code",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -64,
        592
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 4: IF 判斷\n\n`jpy_rate > 155` ？\n\ntrue = 日圓貶值 = 換匯划算\nfalse = 還沒到甜蜜點\n\n數值比較 = L05 IF 節點",
        "height": 260,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "p2-sticky-if",
      "name": "Sticky Note — IF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        592
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 5: Set 格式化\n\ntrue / false 各一個 Set\n用 Expression 組合訊息：\n\n`旅遊匯率看板`\n`日圓：{{ $json.jpy_label }}`\n`判斷：...`\n\n文字串接 = L06 Set 節點",
        "height": 280,
        "color": 2
      },
